  {"comment": "Rib1 (F11), 2 thick, down to the floor (flipped To Next), Extend Ends: the slab x = 19 to 21 between the walls, the floor and z = 20; its ends fill up to the slanted walls. Over x0 - 1 to x0 + 1 the room is W = 42.5 - 0.25 x wide and H = 10 + 0.08 x high: 2 W(x0) H(x0) - 2 / 3 x 0.25 x 0.08. At x0 = 20: 870 - 0.0133333."},
