  {"comment": "Four ribs 20 apart along X toward the narrow, deep end (RectangularPattern1, F12, Adjust): each copy is built again where it lands, cut back to the walls there (its line sticks out past their outer faces) and reaching the lower floor: 858, 814 and 738 less 0.0133333 each more (moved as built, the copies would stick out through the walls and stop short of the floor)."},
